.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-pick-drafts 1  "drafts " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-pick\-drafts \- Pick a draft and print its path
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc pick drafts\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-multi\fR] [\fB\-\-lines\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-size\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pick a draft and print its path
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-multi\fR
Allow selecting multiple drafts
.TP
\fB\-\-lines\fR
Print multiple selections one per line instead of comma\-separated
.TP
\fB\-\-page\-size\fR \fI<PAGE_SIZE>\fR
Number of picker rows to show (default: [lookup] page_size)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
